OL,3,AMajor gangland figure Steven Daniel
OL,4,Aarrested in organised crime raid
OL,5,
OL,6,FOne of Scotland's most high-profile
OL,7,Fgangland figures has been arrested
OL,8,Fduring an early morning police raid.
OL,10,FSteven 'Bonzo' Daniel, 46 was taken
OL,11,Finto custody at around 06:00 from his
OL,12,Fhome in Robroyston in the north of
OL,13,FGlasgow.
OL,15,FDaniel is understood to be the head of
OL,16,Fthe notorious Daniel crime family which
OL,17,Fhas been engaged in a violent feud with
OL,18,Fthe rival Lyons family for 25 years.
OL,23,APub: 26-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB Nat NewsC Nat TVF Clean Feed
